                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c9d2015d-08dd-3804-8a2a-552f16d56b64",
                        "entry_id": "1ea52b3d-c226-3adb-a0d4-6683f2263ffa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. человек, у которого поведение, поступки, склонности (особенно в сексуальной сфере) носят извращённый характер, противоречат физиологическим, социальным или этическим нормам"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "357f76e5-0ef8-490c-b221-a85b090286b8",
                                "sense_id": "c9d2015d-08dd-3804-8a2a-552f16d56b64",
                                "text": "При этом они поголовно являлись сексуальными извращенцами и вступали друг с другом в самые противоестественные отношения."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3371e14a-b0b0-4502-9192-a1e61bda6b2b",
                        "source_entry_id": "1ea52b3d-c226-3adb-a0d4-6683f2263ffa",
                        "source_sense_id": "c9d2015d-08dd-3804-8a2a-552f16d56b64",
                        "target_lang_word": "pervert",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pervert",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0ce0a0e-aeb1-32fb-b0d9-c6a826bd85fa",
                                        "entry_id": "5968a8ae-545c-362c-8aef-01193c91aac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who has been perverted; one who has turned to error, or adopted a twisted sense of values or morals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f1a0df1-9e52-4df7-a08c-71a946a41e61",
                                                "sense_id": "a0ce0a0e-aeb1-32fb-b0d9-c6a826bd85fa",
                                                "text": "And yet it is not only tolerated, but perverts are making to it in England and this country, — perverts among the intelligent and the learned. For these things, which I have quoted, are not accusations made in a corner, but have been published in the face of the world by one of the profoundest theologians of the day, and challenge confutation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffbd1a15-a93f-41c0-8e37-51896ca29bf6",
                                                "sense_id": "a0ce0a0e-aeb1-32fb-b0d9-c6a826bd85fa",
                                                "text": "[…] a religious pervert is ever a doubtful product. One separated from the fellows of his youth and the faith of his fathers, by acceptance of a different religion, is of necessity more or less adrift on the sea of life […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90d58b95-90f3-4b83-818c-1b07741994a7",
                                                "sense_id": "a0ce0a0e-aeb1-32fb-b0d9-c6a826bd85fa",
                                                "text": "According to the Holy Qur'an, those who cast off God's signs and follow Satan and their caprice are perverts; they are likened to dogs […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c78a4a51-84f5-3142-8b2f-d4ddefc23429",
                                        "entry_id": "5968a8ae-545c-362c-8aef-01193c91aac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person whose sexual habits are not considered acceptable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bb9d806-41db-41ee-bddb-dcf67ad1c341",
                                                "sense_id": "c78a4a51-84f5-3142-8b2f-d4ddefc23429",
                                                "text": "Those perverts were trying to spy on us while we changed clothes!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "179ccea2-9c74-4dfb-98e5-2ebfc735126b",
                                                "sense_id": "c78a4a51-84f5-3142-8b2f-d4ddefc23429",
                                                "text": "I know more damn perverts, at schools and all, than anybody you ever met, and they're always being perverty when I'm around."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pervert",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15f21ad2-9855-363e-861e-9b52c772678e",
                                        "entry_id": "f2d76b3d-ff2c-3fd5-8ed3-08c7608ed579",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To turn another way; to divert."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e24e480d-aba8-48da-89ac-5382c89e0d8e",
                                                "sense_id": "15f21ad2-9855-363e-861e-9b52c772678e",
                                                "text": "Let's follow him, and pervert the present wrath."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e900be0a-3d98-307f-894c-39e7051d941c",
                                        "entry_id": "f2d76b3d-ff2c-3fd5-8ed3-08c7608ed579",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To corrupt; to cause to be untrue; corrupted or otherwise impure"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9639fd20-3d64-4379-b324-87f19ed9b2ac",
                                                "sense_id": "e900be0a-3d98-307f-894c-39e7051d941c",
                                                "text": "How could stopping someone from killing himself or herself \"pervert the course of justice\"?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6640c9ac-eac0-4dc2-9e21-873744a1570e",
                                                "sense_id": "e900be0a-3d98-307f-894c-39e7051d941c",
                                                "text": "He, in the serpent, had perverted Eve."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3b2b2ab-dc78-49e2-ac13-fab094ef2b3d",
                                                "sense_id": "e900be0a-3d98-307f-894c-39e7051d941c",
                                                "text": "He was a good Proteſtant, but when he fell into the Jeſuits hands, they ſoon perverted him, and made him embrace the Roman Catholick Religion […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c9b5c34-60ad-45a9-8b08-10e7447b74f9",
                                                "sense_id": "e900be0a-3d98-307f-894c-39e7051d941c",
                                                "text": "A spokesman for Lothian and Borders Police said: \"We can confirm that a 15-year-old boy has been arrested and charged in connection with the murder of Jodi Jones. A 45-year-old has also been arrested in connection with allegations of attempting to pervert the course of justice. A report on this has been sent to the procurator fiscal.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "979cb38d-fd7a-3384-8085-87a2bcb22b0e",
                                        "entry_id": "f2d76b3d-ff2c-3fd5-8ed3-08c7608ed579",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To misapply, misuse, use for a nefarious purpose"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9c6bd1f-9bfc-4d20-aa0d-3ca91dbc396e",
                                                "sense_id": "979cb38d-fd7a-3384-8085-87a2bcb22b0e",
                                                "text": "He has perverted his talents to dishonest gain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83ab4d8e-6e05-3396-8806-9f8da634bc46",
                                        "entry_id": "f2d76b3d-ff2c-3fd5-8ed3-08c7608ed579",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "to misinterpret designedly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24f9a402-90ef-477f-b3e0-9732edf17325",
                                                "sense_id": "83ab4d8e-6e05-3396-8806-9f8da634bc46",
                                                "text": "pervert one's words"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ebd52ecc-d2f4-38f1-b9ac-8f5c5042abdd",
                                        "entry_id": "f2d76b3d-ff2c-3fd5-8ed3-08c7608ed579",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become perverted; to take the wrong course."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8db3f3b-f965-48d0-81a2-89eb2a2cd31f",
                                                "sense_id": "ebd52ecc-d2f4-38f1-b9ac-8f5c5042abdd",
                                                "text": "After that worde, \"better is it to dey than lyve false,\" and al wolde perverted people false reporte make"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
